---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import site from '../data/site.json';

const { business, contact } = site;
const tel = contact.phoneHref || contact.phone;
const phone = contact.phone;
const lastUpdated = 'September 17, 2026';
---

<Base>
  <Header />
  <main class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5 py-20 md:py-28">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
      <span class="helix h-5 w-1.5 rounded-full" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <span class="ledger text-xs text-accent">The fine print</span>
    </div>
    <h1 class="mt-4 text-5xl font-extrabold text-ink md:text-6xl">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="ledger mt-4 text-[0.7rem] text-ink-3">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>

    <div class="mt-10 space-y-12">
      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-ink-2">
        {business.name} is a one-chair barbershop in Cove, Utah, run by Max, taking clients from
        across Cache Valley. This policy explains what limited information this site collects when
        you visit or get in touch, and how it is used. The short version: the site is built to stay
        quiet. It runs no advertising trackers, sets no advertising cookies, and only handles the
        details you choose to send when you reach out to book.
      </p>

      <section class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-ink">Information you give us</h2>
        <p class="leading-relaxed text-ink-2">
          When you call or text {phone}, or send a message through the contact form on this site,
          you share the details you choose to give. The contact form collects your name, email,
          phone number, and your message. That information is used for one thing: to respond to you
          and book your appointment. It is not sold, rented, or used for marketing.
        </p>
        <p class="leading-relaxed text-ink-2">
          Form submissions are handled by a form service that relays them by email to the shop, and
          calls and texts go straight to Max's phone. Please send only what you are comfortable
          sharing.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-ink">Information collected automatically</h2>
        <p class="leading-relaxed text-ink-2">
          Like every website, this one is served over the internet, so some standard technical
          information reaches the hosting provider whenever a page loads. This site is hosted on
          Cloudflare, and Cloudflare processes standard request data such as your IP address,
          browser type, and the referring page in order to deliver the site and keep it secure. This
          is ordinary server and network information, not something the shop reviews about you
          personally.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-ink">Analytics</h2>
        <p class="leading-relaxed text-ink-2">
          This site uses Cloudflare Web Analytics to understand roughly how many people visit and
          which pages they read. It is privacy-first by design: it sets no cookies, does not use
          fingerprinting, and collects no personal information. It does not build a profile of you or
          follow you across other sites.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-ink">Cookies</h2>
        <p class="leading-relaxed text-ink-2">
          This site sets no advertising cookies and runs no cross-site tracking. There is no ad
          network and no marketing pixel here. The site does load fonts from Google Fonts so the
          pages render as intended, and when a font loads your browser requests it from Google, which
          means Google may log standard request data such as your IP address as part of serving the
          font.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-ink">Your choices and rights</h2>
        <p class="leading-relaxed text-ink-2">
          Your personal information is never sold. You can ask to see, correct, or delete any details
          you have sent to the shop at any time by getting in touch. Under laws such as the
          California Consumer Privacy Act, California residents may opt out of the sharing of personal
          information for advertising. This site does not share your information for advertising, so
          there is nothing to opt out of.
        </p>
        <p class="leading-relaxed text-ink-2">
          To make any request, call or text {phone}.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-ink">Changes and contact</h2>
        <p class="leading-relaxed text-ink-2">
          This policy may be updated from time to time. When it changes, the "Last updated" date at
          the top of this page will change with it. If you have any questions about privacy or about
          the information you have shared, call or text Max at
          <a
            href={`tel:${tel}`}
            class="text-accent underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-ink">{phone}</a
          >.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Base>
